 Beginning Comes After the End The changes amount to nothing less than dism
 antling an old civilization and building a new one\, whose newness is ofte
 n the return of the old ways and wisdoms. In this rising worldview\, inter
 connection is a core idea and value. But because the transformation has ha
 ppened in so many disparate arenas\, and within a longer arc of history\, 
 the scale of that change is seldom recognized. #block-49301595ba476ddf6c43
